        "statement": "By leveraging a central resource for Commercial Excellence, Industry 4.0, Industrial Internet of Things (\"IIoT\") and our software products, we are able to capture efficiencies in our digital transformation efforts, improve product security, and offer better efficiency in providing support and engineering for our software and connected products to keep our projects cost-competitive.",
